Components of the App:

This application uses Newsinfo Module class with a retrofit builder dependency to access the base URL for the API.
Retrofit is a dependency that lets you connect to the API through the network connection.
It also contains the Moshi dependency for converting(serialize/deserialize) the JSON into Kotlin objects.
We use a Data Access Object to interact with the database data.
The database contains info that is looked up.
The database is built on Room database dependency.
Dependency injection is used for loose coupling of kotlin objects.
The newsInfoModule is used for dependency injection.


